On Mon, May 19, 2025 at 6:15=E2=80=AFAM Ketan Talaulikar via Datatracker <
noreply@ietf.org> wrote:

>
> 2) Please state in the introduction section on what part of 8422 is being
> updated by this document.
>

I'm actually not sure it does. I'll start a separate thread.



>
> 4) Ref section 1.4 - does this document also not update RFC7627 with its
> terminology change?
>

I'm not sure I understand this question.


>
> 6) I believe there is an error with the reference to RFC8444. That one is=
 a
> OSPF routing protocol extension and don't see how that comes into TLS lan=
d.
>

Correct. It is 8844. https://github.com/tlswg/tls13-spec/pull/1387

-Ekr

--000000000000f16f6e06365c50a5
